        "text": "Adam Schiff is a member of the House Select Committee investigating the January 6th attack.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The lawsuit aims to prevent the committee from accessing records from Trump's administration.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The House Select Committee is meeting today to pursue criminal contempt charges against Steve Bannon.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Steve Bannon has refused to cooperate with the investigation by declining to provide documents and testimony.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The January 6th attack resulted in deaths and nearly disrupted the congressional certification of the electoral vote count.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
