        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The media plays a key role in informing citizens about high-stakes governmental processes.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "A book like 'Midnight in Washington' contributes meaningfully to public understanding of democratic risks.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience trusts the journalist's framing of events as credible and factually grounded.",
