  {
    "episode_id": 92681,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92681.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "As we're learning, though, it is quite a long process from here, as you say, needing to go to the house for a vote to request this legal action then to the U.S. Attorney to consult with the Justice Department and then potentially a trial. And do you have reason to believe it won't be as long and drawn out as it sounds? Like, are the wheels already turning? Do you have some insight on that?",
