        "text": "The speaker trusts that the procedural sequence outlined is accurate and representative of actual legal processes.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that if the process were moving faster, they would likely know through official channels or public updates.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that someone else may have access to inside or timely information about the progress of the case.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
