  {
    "episode_id": 92681,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92681.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Well, that would be, you know, that's the role of the Justice Department. So Congress won't have a role in that apart from making that referral and documenting why he should be prosecuted. So we'll be up to the Justice Department to pursue that case and with a lack ready and pursue it in the criminal justice system.",
