    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "So while all of this is going on, President Trump, former President Trump has filed a lawsuit with the DC District Court to stop the National Archives from releasing White House records around the attack, citing executive privilege. First, what's your reaction to that? That was filed yesterday.",
