    "turn_text": "Support for KQBD podcasts comes from Earth Justice. As a national legal nonprofit, Earth Justice has more than 200 full-time lawyers who fight for a healthy environment. They wield the power of the law to protect people's health, preserve magnificent places in wildlife, and advance clean energy to combat climate change. Earth Justice fights in court because the Earth needs a good lawyer. Learn more about how you can get involved and become a supporter at EarthJustice.org.",
