        "text": "The speaker views the use of personal anecdotes as a legitimate way to convey political criticism.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The term 'disdain' implies a moral judgment on the part of the interlocutor toward McCarthy.",
        "confidence": 0.89
