        "text": "The most common question I receive from constituents and others nationwide is whether Republicans truly believe their public statements.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "I shared an airplane ride with Ken McCarthy on United Airlines while traveling back to Washington, D.C.",
