  {
    "episode_id": 92681,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92681.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 61,
    "turn_text": "Thank you so much. I just finished your book and I just want to say I think I speak for millions of people and I say Thank you so much for your public service. We really need people like you. And just thank you so much. I wanted to get back to the question of delay and what is the timeframe that we're looking at? If there is a referral to the Justice Department for Steve Bannon's refusal to appear, how long can we expect it to take for there to be some actual prosecution and a trial?",
