  {
    "episode_id": 92681,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92681.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 65,
    "turn_text": "Yes. So my question is, I would most like to know the origins of the insurrection. Who funded it? Who are really the people behind it? This is not by any stretch of the imagination, a spontaneous exhibition. Somebody paid for those people to come from across the country to stay in those hotels. Why can't we find out who is behind this and go after them?",
