  },
  {
    "episode_id": 92681,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92681.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 68,
    "turn_text": "Well, James writes, I understand the need to investigate any involvement of members of the government in enabling the attack on Congress. But at what point does this become another Benghazi-like witch hunt that only continues to polarize citizens while Congress sits on popular bipartisan infrastructure legislation that is 20 years overdue? There's that strain of maybe we just need to move on that we were touching on earlier. In",
