        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Citizens are emotionally affected by political polarization, and sustained conflict harms democratic discourse.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Moving on from past controversies is a legitimate and responsible approach when progress is blocked.",
