    "turn_text": "Hi, well, first I want to thank you for all you're doing to try to keep Trump and his posse accountable for what they have done and what they continue to do to our country. But my question has to do with how do you maintain civility when dealing, you know, you told the story that you had with McCarthy on the airplane, but how do you maintain civility dealing with them with McCarthy, newness, Marjorie Tyler Greene, I would find that extremely difficult. We just have some sort of relationship with them.",
