        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Civility requires intentional effort even when facing ideological opponents.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener’s experience with McCarthy provides relevant insight into maintaining composure under pressure.",
