    "turn_text": "You have said that you absolutely believe Donald Trump will run again in 2024. And I'm just thinking around this question of civility that Bernardo is raising. I mean, if the Republican Party embraces him as a candidate, I can't even imagine what bipartisanship could even look like at that point. But do you think the party will embrace him? And do you think he'd win?",
