  {
    "episode_id": 92681,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92681.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 80,
    "turn_text": "Yes. I want to thank Mr. Schiff for all the work that he's doing. Unfortunately, we live in a time where even the glaring truth is not believed and is not seized by a large fraction of the public, and messaging is increasingly becoming a critical factor. So my question is, what is the committee's plan for messaging the results of the investigation? You",
